First-time Restaurant Setup

POST /api/v1/onboarding/restaurant/

Your frontend progress bar can be:

Step 1
Organization
   ↓
Step 2
Owner / User
   ↓
Step 3
Location
   ↓
Step 4
Review
   ↓
Create Restaurant


