Backend transaction

BEGIN TRANSACTION

Create User
     ↓
Create Organization
     ↓
Create OrganizationMembership
     role = OWNER
     ↓
Create Location
     ↓
COMMIT


B. Check Onboarding Status
GET /api/v1/onboarding/status/

Useful if the user closes the browser halfway through onboarding.

Example:

{
    "completed": false,
    "organization_created": true,
    "owner_created": true,
    "location_created": false,
    "next_step": "LOCATION"
}

